{"id":"u-6331ef7b-ad6c-4b38-b87d-ac0f13ab3a0a","src":"community","title":"PPL-PUMP BODYBUILDING","author":"Frank A.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ch2NoR-ppl-pump-1","desc":"Pure Bodybuilding program to gain size. With focus on recovery and low CNS fatiguing exercises.\n\nWe will build volume and intensity over 5 weeks before a deload. \n\nDouble progression: Start with a weight that makes you 2-4 reps shy of the reps given and increase the weight when you hit the target reps for 2 sets in a row.\n\nMonday, Wednesday ,Friday, and Saturday\n\nFeel free to swap machines and exercises for similar ones that feel best for you, but try to stick to the order.\n\nQuad and Glute volume very similar as most men do not do enough glute volume and this creates imbalances and lower back problems. (Trust me)","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:39:16.228Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["PULL","PUSH","LEGS","PUMP"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Split Squat (Front Elevated)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Ab Wheel","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"Single Arm Iso Row","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hamst